[2025-04-14 22:05:18,221][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9][0x9][0x9][0x9]<comments>https://krebsonsecurity.com/2025/03/clickfix-how-to-infect-your-pc-in-three-easy-steps/#comments</comments>[\n]"
