[2025-04-14 22:05:23,817][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-56 << "                                    A threat actor, 'Jabaroot,' claims to have breached Morocco's National Social Security Fund (CNSS), compromising the data of nearly 2 million citizens. The leak includes personal and financial details like passports, emails, and banking information, posing significant identity theft and fraud risks for those affected.[\n]"
[2025-04-14 22:05:23,817][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-56 << "                                </span>[\n]"
