[2025-04-14 22:05:23,817][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-56 << "                                    Fortinet warns that threat actors can maintain access to FortiGate VPN devices after patching by creating symbolic links to the root file system via SSL-VPN, allowing read-only access. Users should upgrade to the latest FortiOS version to eliminate malicious files and check configurations for unauthorized changes.[\n]"
